<title>USA: New York Bancorp sets 10 pct stock buyback.</title>
<headline>New York Bancorp sets 10 pct stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DOUGLASTON, N.Y. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Bancorp Inc said Friday that its board approved the repurchase of up to 10 percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>New York said it had about 11.5 million shares outstanding as of June 30.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
